      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CROYDON REIGN (4) wound up strongly to place two back then did the same last time, finishing on late when second (31.25) in a Grade 6 at this track. Form here is sound including two wins. Has a solid record from this box including two wins and a minor placing. Overdue and gets her chance. ZIPPING RAPUNZEL (3) is rarely far away but tends to find one better, placing 12 from 25 starts. Has hit the frame the last two runs, the latest when second (20.09) at Murray Bridge Straight. Solid record at the distance winning three races. The form from her last run stacks up well. Ready to find winning form. BEDEVILLED (2) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing seventh (31.29) in a Grade 6 at Angle Park. The form out of her last race has been franked. Should be thereabouts. BRUCE WAYNE (7) will be hard to beat despite making his debut at this circuit.",
